:: Woods Foxes Play With [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
You are wondering around the woods when you suddenly see a flash of orange in the nearby bushes. Your ears perk up and your tail begins to wag as you feel the presence of friends nearby. <span style="color:LightGreen">You carefully approach the bush when a small litter of foxes suddenly burst out and begin to yip and nibble at your feet! You laugh, their tiny bites more ticklish than anything, until one leaps up on you and knocks you backwards onto the ground.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

From there, you fall prey to your playful companions’ licks as they swarm you, licking your face, belly, and limbs. You spend the next few minutes rolling and playing around with the collection of young foxes, fully understanding their actions despite their inability to speak. <span style="color:BlueViolet">One bright side of the kitsune spirit inside of you being your ability to connect with these creatures on such a deeper level.</span> <br>
<br>
You’re not sure when you pass out, but you wake up some time later cuddling and wrapped in the warm fur of the other foxes. You stand up and stretch, the foxes waking up as well and making adorable yawning noises. They look up at you before fleeing back into the woods. <span style="color:LightGreen">Not much time has passed since you first entered the woods, yet you feel as though you just had a long, refreshing nap.</span> <br>
<<addMoodlet "Stress" 0>>
<<needChange "Fun" 10>>
<<needChange "Energy" 10>>
<br>
[[Continue|Wald Street]]